features.spec:
Read only conversation (string). Turns are headed by a speaker label at the start of the text or after a blank line, matching regex r'(?:^|

)\[([^\]
]+)\]: '. Extract the ordered list of speaker labels. If conversation is null/unparseable return null; if no labels are found return 0. Return 1 if there exist indices i<j<k with label[i]==label[k] and label[j]!=label[i] (i.e. a back-and-forth exchange of at least three turns including a return by the same speaker after another participant), else 0. Do not use delta or any view-change text. Limitation: labels may include OP and other users; the conversation may include later replies; chronology is taken from text order only.

